<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Happy Birthday My Bujji ❤️</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: #000;
  color: #fff;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  text-align: center;
}

.container {
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 15px;
}

img {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 15px #ff4da6;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

h1 {
  color: #ff4da6;
  font-size: 30px;
  margin-top: 20px;
}

h2 {
  color: #ff4da6;
  font-size: 22px;
}

.letter {
  background: #111;
  padding: 15px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  margin: 20px 0;
  text-align: left;
  line-height: 1.6;
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff4da6;
}

audio {
  width: 100%;
  margin-top: 20px;
  outline: none;
  border-radius: 10px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<h1>Happy Birthday My Bujji ❤️</h1>

<!-- Background Music -->
<audio controls autoplay loop>
  <source src="/assets/audio.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
</audio>

<!-- IMAGES -->
<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karthiiiik14-jpg/my-future/caf8f6d0e52903c896b1631514ad9a2df9b5e7ad/dhanya.1.jpeg" alt="Dhanya 1">
<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karthiiiik14-jpg/my-future/main/d.2.jpeg" alt="Dhanya 2">
<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karthiiiik14-jpg/my-future/main/d.3.jpeg" alt="Dhanya 3">
<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karthiiiik14-jpg/my-future/main/d.4.jpeg" alt="Dhanya 4">
<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karthiiiik14-jpg/my-future/main/d.5.jpeg" alt="Dhanya 5">
<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karthiiiik14-jpg/my-future/main/d.6.jpeg" alt="Dhanya 6">
<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karthiiiik14-jpg/my-future/main/d.7.jpeg" alt="Dhanya 7">
<img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/karthiiiik14-jpg/my-future/main/d.8.jpeg" alt="Dhanya 8">

<!-- LETTER 1 -->
<div class="letter">
<h2>Letter 1 ❤️</h2>
<p>
Hi Bujii,<br><br>
Happy Birthday. I have dreamt many years ago this would happen.  
When I saw you in university for the first time, I felt you are my future wife.  
It started on May 21st and it continues. I love you so much.  
I know you got hurt. Sorry… still I love you so much.<br><br>

I don’t know how to tell everything.  
I know how many papers I wasted trying to explain my feelings.  
I filled you in every inch of my heart.  
I think about you always.  
I wait for your call.  
I pray to God every day to give you to me.<br><br>

Don’t laugh at my grammar mistakes.  
When I see you, my heart is full of joy.  
When you finish your lunch, I get disappointed because I want more time with you.  
I want to tell you: eat slowly… speak with me some more time.  
I am dying here to talk with you, but I stop myself.
</p>
</div>

<!-- LETTER 2 -->
<div class="letter">
<h2>Letter 2 ❤️</h2>
<p>
Please give me a chance, Bujji.  
Don’t think I am begging.  
I love you so much.  
I will never disappoint you.  
I will be loyal to you.  
I will always speak the truth.  
You are my choice in everything.<br><br>

We will build a life together.  
We will grow together.  
I want to be with you every time.  
I want to see you.  
I want to listen to you.<br><br>

I know you don’t have feelings for me now.  
I pray every day to God:  
“Please give some feelings for me to Dhanya.”  
Then she will love me like I love her.<br><br>

I love you, Bujji.  
Please give me a chance, my heroine.  
Happy Birthday, Bujji.<br><br>

Don’t think I am mature while writing this letter.  
My inner child wrote this.<br><br>

Karthik
</p>
</div>

<h1>❤️ Will You Be Mine, Bujji? ❤️</h1>

</div>

</body>
</html>
